GET /foo HTTP/1.1
Host: example.com
Sec-CH-UA-Platform-Version: &quot;6.1.25&quot;
Sec-CH-UA-Bitness: &quot;64&quot;

HTTP/1.1 301 Moved Permanently
Accept-CH: Sec-CH-UA-Platform-Version,Sec-CH-UA-Bitness
Critical-CH: Sec-CH-UA-Platform-Version
Location: /bar

GET /bar
Sec-CH-UA-Platform-Version: &quot;6.1.25&quot;
Sec-CH-UA-Bitness: &quot;64&quot;
Host: example.com

HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Accept-CH: Sec-CH-UA-Platform-Version,Sec-CH-UA-Bitness
Critical-CH: Sec-CH-UA-Platform-Version"><pre class="notranslate"><code>GET /foo HTTP/1.1
Host: example.com

